                <pb facs="0786" n="776" xml:id="pg776"/>

                <head>Appendix C to HD–76</head>
                <p rendition="#center">(<hi rendition="#small-caps">embargo on german shipping in
                        the baltic</hi>)</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Proposed Draft Reply to the German
                        Delegation Note of 17 October, Prepared by the Allied Naval
                    Advisers</hi></p>
                <p>The Allied and Associated Governments have examined the request contained in the
                    Note of 17 October from the German Government,<anchor n="12" xml:id="d35-f1"/>
                    concerning the restrictions placed on the sailings of German fishing vessels and
                    other small craft in the Baltic, and have instructed A.N.A.C.<anchor n="13"
                        xml:id="d35-f2"/> to take whatever steps are possible to meet the requests
                    of the German Government, in so far as these steps do not interfere with any
                    military measures that are considered necessary.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-24">24 <hi rendition="#small-caps">October</hi>,
                            1919</date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
